        "text": "Because we regularly prepare clients for interviews in the Dallas region, we can describe how these interviews typically flow, not just in theory but in practice. We walk clients through the physical layout, expected wait times, and the sequence of steps so that nothing about the day feels unfamiliar. That familiarity allows you to focus on what truly matters, which is how you explain your investment and your personal history once the questions begin."
