        "type": "p",
        "text": "Effective EB-5 interview preparation is more than handing you a list of possible questions. At Akula & Associates, we start with a thorough review of your entire EB-5 file, including the petition, supporting exhibits, and any updates since filing. We identify areas that are complex, such as layered corporate ownership, mixed sources of funds, or prior immigration history, and we flag points that are likely to draw officer attention in a Dallas related interview."
