        "text": "From there, we work with you to develop a preparation plan. That often includes organizing a clean set of documents for interview day, clarifying your financial and project narrative, and scheduling mock interview sessions. During mock interviews, we ask the types of questions we have seen officers ask in similar cases and then push a bit further, so you are ready for follow ups. This process helps you practice responding in your own words while keeping your answers aligned with the documents."
