        "text": "Our diverse, multilingual team means we can conduct parts of this preparation in languages such as Spanish, Hindi, Urdu, Thai, Lao, Hausa, Russian, and Armenian when that is more comfortable for you. We then help you refine English answers for the interview itself. With more than 30 years of combined immigration law experience and a collaborative approach, our attorneys bring both technical knowledge and practical insight to each EB-5 preparation engagement."
